<title>POLAND: KPBP-BICK GROUP NET RISES IN 1996.</title>
<headline>KPBP-BICK GROUP NET RISES IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>KPBP-Bick group results for the</p>
<p>year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		     2.32   vs    2.66</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			 3.43   vs    2.67</p>
<p>    Group net profit			     2.04   vs    1.72</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: KPBP-Bick SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			     78.22   vs   58.26</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales			69.77   vs   51.21</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary profit		 0.04   vs    0.29</p>
<p>    Group income tax			     1.38   vs    1.07</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues		   2.65   vs    0.76</p>
<p>    Group financial costs			1.62   vs    0.48</p>
<p>    Group investment			    10.74   vs    3.40</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
